#: confusb/kb.py:17
msgid "PC/SC service and CCID drivers"
msgstr "Servizz PC/SC u drivers CCID"

#: confusb/kb.py:18
msgid "pcscd is the daemon that manages smart card readers; libccid provides the driver for standard USB readers (CCID). Without pcscd the reader shows up in USB but no application can use it."
msgstr "pcscd huwa d-demon li jimmaniġġja l-qarrejja tal-karti intelliġenti; libccid jipprovdi d-driver għall-qarrejja USB standard (CCID). Mingħajr pcscd il-qarrej jidher fl-USB iżda ebda applikazzjoni ma tista' tużah."

#: confusb/kb.py:22
msgid "OpenSC (PKCS#11, supports DNIe and other cards)"
msgstr "OpenSC (PKCS#11, jappoġġja d-DNIe u karti oħra)"

#: confusb/kb.py:23
msgid "Library and tools for cryptographic cards. It includes support for the DNIe (3.0/4.0) and the PKCS#11 module used by Firefox/Chromium and AutoFirma. Older DNIe cards (2.0) may need the official DNIe module."
msgstr "Librerija u għodod għal karti kriptografiċi. Tinkludi appoġġ għad-DNIe (3.0/4.0) u l-modulu PKCS#11 użat minn Firefox/Chromium u AutoFirma. Id-DNIe eqdem (2.0) jistgħu jeħtieġu l-modulu uffiċjali tad-DNIe."

